            "id": "INV-011",
            "text": "CTZ(x) can be computed from CLZ as: CTZ(x) = 255 - CLZ(x & -x) for nonzero x, and CTZ(0) = 256."
          },
          {
            "id": "INV-012",
            "text": "CLZ cannot be implemented using CTZ alone."
          }
