        "id": "SG-008",
        "name": "Backwards Compatibility",
        "description": "Documents the backwards compatibility status. CLZ (opcode 0x1e) is a new opcode that was not present in any prior EVM version. There are no backwards compatibility issues since no existing contract uses opcode 0x1e.",
        "invariants": [
          {
            "id": "INV-016",
            "text": "Opcode 0x1e was previously undefined/invalid, so introducing CLZ does not change the behavior of any existing valid contract."
          }
